            "detailed_description": "88 year, in Africa there was a crisis and riots broke out. All these events force the usual African guy Abig to become a pirate - to destroy planes and rob them to earn money for survival.<br />\r\nPlay for Abig and destroy planes, catch humanitarian cargo, and dodge of rockets.<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n-Ability to be an African pirate<br />\r\n-Different types of planes (3 types of planes)<br />\r\n-Good soundtrack<br />\r\n-Simple and fun gameplay<br />\r\n-Steam achievements<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAbout planes:<br />\r\n1 type of planes- transport, they need to be knocked down and for each destroyed plane the player gets +1 to points.<br />\r\n2 type of planes- cargo, they do not need to be knocked down, for each destroyed plane the player gets -5 to points. A cargo plane sometimes drops a humanitarian cargo, for the assembly of which the player gets +1 to points<br />\r\n3 type of planes- combat (military), they need to be brought down, for each destroyed plane the player gets  +1 to points. Also this kind can shoot rockets, you need to shy away from them, so as not to die",
            "about_the_game": "88 year, in Africa there was a crisis and riots broke out. All these events force the usual African guy Abig to become a pirate - to destroy planes and rob them to earn money for survival.<br />\r\nPlay for Abig and destroy planes, catch humanitarian cargo, and dodge of rockets.<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n-Ability to be an African pirate<br />\r\n-Different types of planes (3 types of planes)<br />\r\n-Good soundtrack<br />\r\n-Simple and fun gameplay<br />\r\n-Steam achievements<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAbout planes:<br />\r\n1 type of planes- transport, they need to be knocked down and for each destroyed plane the player gets +1 to points.<br />\r\n2 type of planes- cargo, they do not need to be knocked down, for each destroyed plane the player gets -5 to points. A cargo plane sometimes drops a humanitarian cargo, for the assembly of which the player gets +1 to points<br />\r\n3 type of planes- combat (military), they need to be brought down, for each destroyed plane the player gets  +1 to points. Also this kind can shoot rockets, you need to shy away from them, so as not to die",
            "short_description": "You are playing for an African pirate and you need to destroy as many planes as possible off the coast of Africa, and also collect humanitarian cargo, and dodge of rockets",
